==============================================================================
PART 2 - SPI clock sweep: repeated init/draw/deinit, plus button presses
Each clock step is a full display init -> 3 patterns -> deinit cycle, so this
also exercises the new drain-before-teardown path. Button taps make the
prd_button task report its own stack.
